[
{ 
  "talkId":1000,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"空空的衣柜,看起来没什么用,以后也许会有用吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1001,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"一个古朴的镜子,一张帅气的脸映在镜子里。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1002,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这个抽屉被锁上了,里面有什么呢？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1003,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你好！有什么事吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1004,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯..你,要干嘛？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1005,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嘿,你今天是来约我一起去冒险吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1006,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"噢,你又发现什么了吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1007,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"风带来了你的讯息.." },
{ 
  "talkId":1008,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"准备好接受你的命运了吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1009,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你知道吗？当年我一个人在战场上…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1010,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"欢迎光临。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1011,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗨,今天天气不错,适合挑选家具哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1012,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"对动物一定要温柔啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1013,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"客人,你想要点什么？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1014,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"想和我来一次命运的邂逅…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1015,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,今天一定不要再犯错。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1016,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"良好的工具可以使工作更有效率。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1017,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你是来参观我的商店的吗？请尽情参观吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1018,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"年轻真好啊,如果可以,我想…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1019,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"小家伙们,来挑点东西吧？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1020,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"太好了,终于有人来陪我了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1021,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"职责、荣耀...抱歉,没看到你。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1022,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"想要料理的话,可以和黛芙妮说。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1023,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"啊！你是在开玩笑吧,不过这个不好笑哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1024,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你,你怎么能这么轻易,说出,这种话…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1025,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果你是一个大英雄就好了…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1026,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"抱歉,我只对考古感兴趣…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1027,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"就让这份情绪随风而逝吧…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1028,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"小家伙,你能驾驭我吗?" },
{ 
  "talkId":1029,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的激情已经留在战场上了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1030,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好高兴哦,不过我还得努力长大才行呢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1031,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,如果可以请在店里买点东西吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1032,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"抱歉,人类的心是会说谎的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1033,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"真的吗,谢谢你给我打气。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1034,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我对长期的感情没有兴趣。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1035,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你说的是什么意思,我听不懂哎…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1036,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我已经对大哥发过誓了,无法接受你的心意。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1037,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"啊,你难道看上我的身家了吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1038,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哎呀,我这可衰老的心可经不起你的挑拨…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1039,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果我还年轻的话…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1040,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"对不起,人鱼和人类是不会有结果的…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1041,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我还是想以我的事业为重…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1042,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"虽然我是想给黛芙妮她们找个父亲,但你就…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1043,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"抱歉,从上次受伤后,我还在修养中,过段时间再来找我吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1044,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我还是想和更熟悉的人一起冒险..." },
{ 
  "talkId":1045,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"OK,那么我们就一起去冒险吧." },
{ 
  "talkId":1046,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,你这么请求的话,我只好答应了." },
{ 
  "talkId":1047,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我早就等着这一天了." },
{ 
  "talkId":1048,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"希望这次会发现一些古代遗迹线索." },
{ 
  "talkId":1049,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好啦,好啦,清风告诉我应该和你一起出动…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1050,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你可要机灵点呀,我可不想让你拖后腿。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1051,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"那么就让你见识一下我英勇的身姿吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1052,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"那么,请多指教了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1053,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好吧,希望会有一个美好的旅程。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1054,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"要紧紧跟着姐姐后面,姐姐会保护你的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1055,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,很久没有出去了,出去走走也不错。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1056,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"既然你这么有诚意,就答应你吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1057,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"正好我也想练习一下我的技能。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1058,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"也应该活动活动手脚了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1059,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你终于认识到我的厉害了啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1060,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果你不嫌弃我这把老骨头的话…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1061,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"偶尔也该让布莱兹独自看店了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1062,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"其实我早就想出去看看了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1063,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"放心吧,战士的职责就是保护平民。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1064,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我也该出去寻找一下新食材了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1065,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢牛奶制品" },
{ 
  "talkId":1066,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢鱼料理" },
{ 
  "talkId":1067,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢生海鲜" },
{ 
  "talkId":1068,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢肉料理" },
{ 
  "talkId":1069,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢汤" },
{ 
  "talkId":1070,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢酒" },
{ 
  "talkId":1071,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢水果" },
{ 
  "talkId":1072,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢米饭料理" },
{ 
  "talkId":1073,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢烧烤" },
{ 
  "talkId":1074,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢刀剑" },
{ 
  "talkId":1075,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢长枪" },
{ 
  "talkId":1076,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢鸡蛋料理" },
{ 
  "talkId":1077,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢鞭子" },
{ 
  "talkId":1078,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢铠甲" },
{ 
  "talkId":1079,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢衣服" },
{ 
  "talkId":1080,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢元素结晶" },
{ 
  "talkId":1081,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢昆虫产物" },
{ 
  "talkId":1082,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢野兽产物" },
{ 
  "talkId":1083,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢蔬菜" },
{ 
  "talkId":1084,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,其实我更喜欢动物食材" },
{ 
  "talkId":1085,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哇！太棒了！是我喜欢的啊！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1086,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"正是我需要的,谢谢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1100,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你知道吗,其实蔬菜里也有很多营养哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1101,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"噢..你想聊什么..真无聊啊" },
{ 
  "talkId":1102,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我知道了,你一定是来偷看我姐姐的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1103,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你有留意旅途中未知的遗迹吗？不知道那些到底代表着什么？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1104,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"啊,风中传来你的气息,让我将思念寄托于你…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1105,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"现在的人类真是太羸弱了,如果是古代那些强悍的战士,周围就不会有怪物存在了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1106,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"在那场战争中,本来王国军处于劣势,但是凭着我的活跃表现,才逆转获得胜利。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1107,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你喜欢吃什么料理呢？奥蒂莉亚喜欢烤海鲜噢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1108,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"真高兴你能来找我玩,明天你还会来吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1109,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"动物是我们的好伙伴,不仅有优良的产出还能跟随我们战斗呢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1110,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"真的很感谢客人对本店的光顾,能帮上妈妈我也很高兴。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1111,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"在这个宁静的小镇,我找到了久违的安心,我想我还会再住一阵子吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1112,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"究竟怎样才能和是否一样优秀呢？这真让我困扰。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1113,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我一定要把布拉德利培养成一个优秀的男人,这就是我生活的意义。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1114,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我曾经走过大山和大海,追寻财富的脚步永不停息,你能理解吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1115,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"唉,过去这么多年来,玛德琳还不肯原谅我吗…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1116,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"可爱的小家伙们,今天又来问候我啊,真的谢谢你们了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1117,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"见到你,多莉丝真高兴,真像能和你一样到处去玩。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1118,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我一定要成为将军那样强大的军人,为此我得坚持锻炼。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1119,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"制作料理一定要有想象力,只有这样才能将美味融入其中。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1200,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"种植是很有学问的,一定要在合适的季节种植作物哦,否则作物的生长时间会变的很长。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1201,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"像我这样的天才果然不应该困在这种小店里吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1202,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我其实一直在锻炼,因为我知道有一天命运会安排我成为救世主。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1203,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"经过我的研究,我推断在远古时代有一个伟大的文明,但是不知为何消失了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1204,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"没必要活得太累,偶尔停下脚步欣赏一下自然也是很好的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1205,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"魔法=百分之九九的天赋+百分之一的努力,所以你似乎无法成为魔法师了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1206,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果不是那件事,王国的军队的总司令官非我莫属了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1207,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"不管下雨还是晴天,我觉得每一天的天气都很好,你觉得呢？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1208,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"其实班尼迪克先生不是你看到的那样,他也有温柔的一面。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1209,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"每天都要记得喂养动物啊,不要让他们挨饿。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1210,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"和你说一会话,真的很轻松,可是我还有工作,不能在和你再聊了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1211,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"漂泊了多年,没想到我还是感到很寂寞,不知道我的归宿在哪里。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1212,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"师父是个大美人吧,不过你可不要打她的主意哦,师父可不是你能驾驭的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1213,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果你学会了制作的话,你就可以自己制作装备了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1214,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"在这个世界上除了人类还有一些奇怪的种族,可是为什么是人类占据了大陆呢？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1215,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你听到了什么？可不要到处乱说啊,这都是我们年轻时发生的事。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1216,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"帕特里克那个老固执还是每天都到广场独坐啊,明明过去那么久了…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1217,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"传说我们人鱼族有一位女孩的鱼尾变成了双脚,走上了陆地呢…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1218,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"其实一个人站岗也挺无聊的,如果有人来和我聊聊的话,我会很高兴。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1219,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果你发现了奇怪的食材,请一定要告诉我。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1300,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"玛德琳奶奶并不是我的亲奶奶哦,但是我觉得他比亲奶奶还要好。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1301,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果没什么事,可以请你离开吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1302,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天我还得看店,不能展示我的雄姿给你看,改天再来吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1303,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这个小镇里应该有一个古代遗迹的,但是我怎么也找不到。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1304,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这里真是一个神奇的地方,你知道吗,在小镇的四周竟然分布着四季。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1305,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"魔法药剂现在还在配置,暂时还无法供应。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1306,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"注意,不要走得太远,外面可是有很多可怕的怪物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1307,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好孩子饮食要均衡哦,不论是蔬菜还是肉类都不能挑食。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1308,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果有一天你要组成家庭,那么你一定要到这里购买家具啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1309,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果可以的话,希望你能多来找格吉尔玩。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1310,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的妈妈好厉害的,很多料理都是她自己发明的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1311,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"呵呵,和你说这么多,你也不懂吧,像你这种小孩子还要多多进行人生历练啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1312,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"最近师父获得了一些魔法药剂的配方,我们正在收集材料调配。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1313,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"一定不要吝啬装备哦,即使不用的装备也可以售卖获得金币。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1314,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"传说中这个世界曾经被魔族统治,不知道是不是真的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1315,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"想不到还会有年轻人来找我这个老头子聊天,真令人高兴。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1316,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"虽然我的道具屋里都是些过时的老东西,但是很用哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1317,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"其实水里也有很多有意思的地方,如果你能在水里生存的话……" },
{ 
  "talkId":1318,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"如果遇到了危险,一定要向我求助,我可是时刻准备着。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1319,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的女儿可是我的心肝宝贝,你可不要想轻易就将他们欺骗到手。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1320,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天是你的生日吧,这是我送你的生日礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1321,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"正好这个用不到了,就送你吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1322,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"一直都收你的礼物,这个就表达一下我的心意吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1323,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这些东西,希望你能用的上。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1324,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"生日快乐哟,希望你喜欢我的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1325,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你是来向我讨礼物的吗？好吧,这个就给你吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1326,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"孩子,恭喜你又长大一岁了,给你我的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1327,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"生日快乐！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1328,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"希望你能喜欢我送你的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1329,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我记得今天是你的生日,给你的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1330,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"生日快乐！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1331,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"希望幸运之神能日日降临于你。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1332,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"咦,今天是你的生日吗？那这个可以作为生日礼物吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1333,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我这里有一些基础材料,送你一些作为生日礼物吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1334,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我记得今天是你的生日,给你的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1335,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"生日快乐哟,希望你喜欢我的礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1336,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天对你是重要的一天,收下我的礼物吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1337,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这是我的一点心意,虽然我没有什么其他东西。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1338,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我只有这些东西,应该能有点用。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1339,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天是你的生日吧,这是我送你的生日礼物。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2001,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2002,
  "text":"马车怎么停下了？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2002,
  "charactorName":"班尼迪克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_20",
  "nexTalkId":2003,
  "text":"看来有怪物逼近了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2003,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2004,
  "text":"那可怎么办？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2004,
  "charactorName":"班尼迪克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_20",
  "nexTalkId":2005,
  "text":"不必担心,凭着我们的几个实力,一般怪物都不难对付！" },
{ 
  "talkId":2005,
  "charactorName":"班尼迪克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_20",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"怪物来了,准备战斗！" },
{ 
  "talkId":2006,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2007,
  "text":"刚才真是危险啊！" },
{ 
  "talkId":2007,
  "charactorName":"班尼迪克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_20",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好,趁现在快点赶到镇子吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2008,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2009,
  "text":"我代表小镇欢迎你,小朋友。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2009,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2010,
  "text":"你的外公已经离开了,就由我来指导你在小镇的生活吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2010,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2011,
  "text":"那么,我该做什么？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2011,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天你已经很累了,先回家好好休息一下,明天再正式开始。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2012,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哎呀,你已经起床了啊,那么我们就先到你外公留下的商店去看看吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2013,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2014,
  "text":"按照你外公的嘱托,我们给你开放了商贸、社交许可,其他的许可还需要你自己努力达成。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2014,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"许可清单就帖在墙上,你可以随时去看看。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2015,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2016,
  "text":"那这些事情具体该怎么做？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2016,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2017,
  "text":"你连这些么简单的东西都不会吗,那就从最简单的售卖开始吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2017,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"看到前面的这桌子了么,点击它,将东西放到上面就行了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2018,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2019,
  "text":"其他的呢？该如何操作？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2019,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2020,
  "text":"现在的年轻人啊,怎么一点探索精神都没有,幸亏我早有准备。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2020,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我在你的书架上放了几卷书籍,上面记载了具体的操作方法。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2021,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2022,
  "text":"好了,我也差不多该休息了,剩下的事该你自己完成了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2022,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2023,
  "text":"你应该不会笨到连看图学做事都不会做吧？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2023,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"呃..我会努力的…" },
{ 
  "talkId":2024,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2025,
  "text":"看来你已经掌握了售卖物品的方法了,如此一来,你的种植许可也开放了,那么现在去买一些种子回来吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2025,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2026,
  "text":"哪里有种子出售？" },
{ 
  "talkId":2026,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"商店街有一家植物店,那里拥有各种植物种子,去看看吧,买完了,记得直接到农场,我在那里等你。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2027,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2028,
  "text":"你来了,现在开始种植吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2028,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"首先要将田地锄松。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2029,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"很好,现在播种吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2030,
  "charactorName":"player",
  "charactorIcon":"playerIcon",
  "nexTalkId":2031,
  "text":"好了,终于完成种植了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2031,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"不,还差最后一步呢,给植物浇水吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2032,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":2033,
  "text":"记住每天都得来浇水啊,不然植物会枯死的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2033,
  "charactorName":"帕特里克",
  "charactorIcon":"head_18",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"植物生长需要几天时间,在此期间,你不如去野外探险一下,也许会获得想不到的收获哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":2034,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的伤势需要休养几天,接下来的事情就要靠你自己努力了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1400,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"多么美丽的花儿啊,真的是送给我的吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1401,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"想用鲜花俘虏我的心吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1402,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哦,太美了,我一直幻想着有人能送我鲜花呢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1403,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你..你是什么意思？,不..不管怎样,谢谢了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1404,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好高兴！竟然可以收到鲜花！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1405,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"没想到像我这种老头子也可以收到年轻孩子的鲜花！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1406,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢,这束鲜花我会铭记在心。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1407,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你的心意,我已知晓。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1408,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"美丽的鲜花代表着美丽的心灵,你是我值得信赖的人…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1409,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"鲜花是英雄的绝配,你真是我的知己…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1410,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"谢谢你,如果可以,能多来陪陪我吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1411,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"鲜花是爱情的魔法,现在我还没办法免疫…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1412,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"收到花儿后,我也感到年轻了呢！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1413,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"生命如花,我的心又变得有活力了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1414,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"愿这份美丽能长存常在！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1415,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"原来,你对我…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1416,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,对我来说,你很特别。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1417,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"看来,我也该有自己的生活了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1418,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的少女心被你勾起了呢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1419,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"令人怀念啊,我的激情岁月。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1420,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天的鲜花已经收到,这份美丽请留到明天。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1421,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好高兴！其实我也喜欢你！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1422,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你..你说什么？既然,你..坚持的话,我..就勉强答应你吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1423,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"那么,今后我们就一起努力吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1424,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,我也该留意一下身边的美丽了,我美丽的女孩。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1425,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"恒久的等待,只为了你的到来,让我们携手向前…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1426,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"虽然并不完美,不过你还是不错的,那就答应你吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1427,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我,真的可以吗？其实我一直都喜欢你！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1428,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"盯…其实我早就知道了,没想到你这么晚才来,你说我该怎么办？亲爱的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1429,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你也是我欣赏的人,今后就请多多关照了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1430,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哇,好羞人,不过我真的好高兴,今后希望能和你一起走下去。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1431,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你是认真的吗？呐,就先相信你吧,如果你欺骗我的话…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1432,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"没想到你会选择我,我也会得到幸福呢。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1433,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"跨种族的爱恋是很困难的,你要做好觉悟哦。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1434,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"亲爱的,你来了,刚才我还在想你呢,嘿嘿。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1435,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"亲..亲爱的,你来这里,有什么事吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1436,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"甜心,看到你,我的心情就变好了,如果可以,希望你能多陪我一会…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1437,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这种枯燥的工作,果然还是需要你的陪伴,今天过来是想干什么呢？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1438,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"吾爱,你如风中的精灵,真想为你献上一首赞美诗.." },
{ 
  "talkId":1439,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"噢,你来了呀,是想我了吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1440,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"刚刚我还在想你,没想到你竟然马上就来了,我好幸福…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1441,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"是你啊,亲爱的,见到你真高兴,你是来看我的吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1442,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"不知道为什么,在见到你之后,心情变得轻松了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1443,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"呐呐,以后等我们组成家庭,我每天给你做便当吃好吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1444,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"亲爱的,我决定了,以后,我的舞姿只会为你而绽放。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1445,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"自从见到了你,我就中了一种叫爱情的魔法。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1446,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"守护这里是我的职责,那么,守护我的就是你了吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1447,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"原来像我这种无名小卒也可以拥有爱情啊,我会珍惜你的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1448,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我要更加努力,我会与你相配的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1449,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"没想到…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1450,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"别以为,我会挽留.." },
{ 
  "talkId":1451,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"哼…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1452,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"请你以后不要来打扰我" },
{ 
  "talkId":1453,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"爱情总以悲剧而告终…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1454,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这还不值得我愤怒…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1455,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"为什么？是我哪里做的不好吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1456,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你这个渣男…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1457,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"人心总是丑陋的…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1458,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"唉,怎么会这样…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1459,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"你胆子很大啊,竟敢这样玩弄我！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1460,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我再也不会相信你了！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1461,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"果然,种族是无法跨越的…" },
{ 
  "talkId":1470,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这里的风景真是美丽啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1471,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"真想在这里多呆一会。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1472,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这里风景也不过如此吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1473,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我们就随便看看吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1474,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"让我们享受这美好的时光吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1475,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我的心灵受到抚慰了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1476,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我真的有这么好吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1477,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"只是山风有些冷啊。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1478,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"呐,我们只是来看风景吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1479,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好啊,大家一起" },
{ 
  "talkId":1480,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"唉,你在做什么？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1481,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"唔,下次可以先告诉我吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1482,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好吧,我们也该迎来一段新生活了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1500,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"花心可是不好的行为。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1501,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"嗯,我也是。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1502,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好吧,那么我们就出发吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1503,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天已经约过了,明天在来吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1504,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好舒服,疲劳都消除了！辛苦你了,亲爱的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1505,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天我已经累了,明天我在为你服务！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1506,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"亲爱的,你已经拿不下了,先把背包腾出一个格子来吧。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1507,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天已经没有了,明天我会早点准备好的。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1508,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"今天辛苦了,有什么需要我服务的吗？" },
{ 
  "talkId":1509,
  "charactorName":"feMeal",
  "charactorIcon":"feMeal",
  "nexTalkId":1510,
  "text":"亲爱的,今天,我的身体有点不舒服。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1510,
  "charactorName":"meal",
  "charactorIcon":"meal",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"怎么了吗？我去找人来给你看看。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1511,
  "charactorName":"玛德琳",
  "charactorIcon":"head_19",
  "nexTalkId":1512,
  "text":"恭喜你们了,你们要有小宝宝了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1512,
  "charactorName":"feMeal",
  "charactorIcon":"feMeal",
  "nexTalkId":1513,
  "text":"这么说,我.." },
{ 
  "talkId":1513,
  "charactorName":"meal",
  "charactorIcon":"meal",
  "nexTalkId":1514,
  "text":"太好了,亲爱的,我们要有孩子了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1514,
  "charactorName":"玛德琳",
  "charactorIcon":"head_19",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"我先走了,过段时间孩子出生时我在来。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1515,
  "charactorName":"玛德琳",
  "charactorIcon":"head_19",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"小宝宝终于出生了,恭喜你们了。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1516,
  "charactorName":"meal",
  "charactorIcon":"meal",
  "nexTalkId":1517,
  "text":"这就是我的孩子！亲爱的,谢谢你！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1517,
  "charactorName":"feMeal",
  "charactorIcon":"feMeal",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"好了,我们该给他取一个名字了！" },
{ 
  "talkId":1518,
  "charactorName":"玛德琳",
  "charactorIcon":"head_19",
  "nexTalkId":1519,
  "text":"真是个好名字,你们可要照顾好这个小家伙呀。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1519,
  "charactorName":"meal",
  "charactorIcon":"meal",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"这是我们的责任。" },
{ 
  "talkId":1600,
  "charactorName":"",
  "charactorIcon":"",
  "nexTalkId":0,
  "text":"多谢你的药,我的身体已经痊愈了,随时来找我组队啊！"}
